wikidot.com/user:info/alty-fmn" >Alty_FMN</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>歌辞终于发人事页啦！<br /> 词穷笨蛋不知道说什么好就奋力打call吧！ —— <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/terancarol" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4100730&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609874659" alt="tERaNCarol" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4100730)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/terancarol" >tERaNCarol</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>给歌辞前辈打Call！(￣∇￣)<br /> 和歌辞前辈相处超级开心的哇！—— Ciphys_X</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>英翻歌辭佬的文是好文明。（一直想英翻但一直被搶的怨念<br /> 我就是要用獨特的方式打call———— —— <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jochoi" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4255421&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609874659" alt="Jochoi" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4255421)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jochoi" >Jochoi</a></span></p> </blockquote> </div> </div> </div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p>再见，以及谢谢所有的鱼。</p> </div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lyrics-linn" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3935168&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609874659" alt="Lyrics Linn" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3935168)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lyrics-linn" >Lyrics Linn</a></span>
